      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s not a garbage. Could you explain why you think that panic_data is corrupted? This function just makes more space for core specific panic data (which is bigger in newer EC) to avoid issues when working with this structure. Struct_size is updated here because after memmove, size of panic_data structure increased actually.",
